  "type": "Manifest",
  "label": {
    "en": [
      "A black-and-white photograph of a snow-covered street flanked by buildings on both sides. The street curves to the left and is lined with distinctively shaped lamp posts. Snow is piled up along the sidewalks and rooftops, with tire tracks visible in the snow. The mountainous background and style of street lamps suggest a Central or Eastern European setting."
